    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce32" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string" table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:number-rows-spanned="4">
      <text:p>The drain current waveform is a ramp on a step. <text:s/>The value of the current at the center of the ramp is equal to the output DC current. <text:s/>The peak inductor current is equal to the output current added to half the peak to peak ripple.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
